# ============================================================================
# niva validation suite — 40 pipelines, simple → complex
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dogfoods niva across data SOURCES (GeoPackage, shapefile, GeoJSON, GeoTIFF,
# JPEG2000, CSV, SpatiaLite, PostGIS @conn, remote WFS, directories), TARGETS
# (GeoPackage / multi-layer / SpatiaLite / shapefile / GeoTIFF / PostGIS
# create·append·replace / Markdown reports), PROCESSING (reproject, buffer,
# clip, dissolve, simplify, centroid, point-on-surface, fixgeom, convex hull,
# bounding box, explode, overlays, spatial join, field ops, raster warp /
# hillshade / slope / clip / zonal stats, sql, run escape hatch, each batch),
# and DATA TYPES (point / line / polygon / multipart, raster, aspatial table).
#
# Run it with the companion runner, which executes each block, ASSESSES the
# output (incl. a non-empty-geometry check — the assertion that catches a
# table loaded as an empty aspatial layer), then CLEANS UP:
#
#   PYTHONPATH=<repo>:/usr/share/qgis/python:/usr/lib/python3/dist-packages \
#     QT_QPA_PLATFORM=offscreen python3 examples/run_validation_suite.py
#
# Outputs land in /tmp/niva_validation/out ; PostGIS tables are nv_* on @localpg
# and dropped by each test's cleanup. The runner directives are:
#   #@out <target> :: <vector|raster|table|file> [>=N]   assertion(s)
#   #@cleanup rm <path>                                  delete a file output
#   #@cleanup flow <niva flow>                           run a cleanup flow
# ============================================================================


# ===== PREAMBLE | environment & data | validate the environment before testing =====
# Confirm QGIS, the registered @conn connections, and the source data are all present.
info to=/tmp/niva_validation/out/00_info.md
show "@localpg" to=/tmp/niva_validation/out/00_localpg.md
show "@actual_spatialite.sqlite" to=/tmp/niva_validation/out/00_spatialite.md
catalog "/home/jcz/Github/niva/data" to=/tmp/niva_validation/out/00_catalog.md
#@out /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_info.md :: file
#@out /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_localpg.md :: file
#@out /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_spatialite.md :: file
#@out /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_catalog.md :: file
#@cleanup rm /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_info.md
#@cleanup rm /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_localpg.md
#@cleanup rm /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_spatialite.md
#@cleanup rm /tmp/niva_validation/out/00_catalog.md


# ----------------------------------------------------------- SIMPLE: load → save

